    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7473-3977"))
Description: Provides report generation tools for the rENM framework,
    including compilation of summary tables, assembly of per-topic report
    pages, and production of the final species report by combining PDF
    products from across the rENM pipeline.
